{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "49ef3091-f2ff-8db0-b4f7-be46c44faff2",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T17:54:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, yeah, hi. I know it's after five, City Hall's closed, I figured this was the line to try. Is it okay to call this late?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:51:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, this line's open after hours for storm stuff and road problems. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:51:18-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's a storm drain. Well, the grate at the curb. It's sunk down, like the whole thing dropped below the street, and when it rains or all that snowmelt comes, the water goes everywhere but down it. It just runs around it and pools across the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:51:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a sunken grate at the curb, water's not going in. Is this since the nor'easter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it got way worse after last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. Two days later and it's still sitting there. It's a big lake out there, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:51:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, we had a lot of water over the weekend. Is it deep enough that cars are having trouble?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:52:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, nobody's stalling, but traffic is slowing to a crawl going through it. Everybody's creeping along because they don't know how deep it is, and then there's a line backed up behind. I've been watching it out my window all afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:52:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's the address, or the nearest cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:52:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, um, I'd rather not give the address on the phone, honestly. Can you work with a description? It's the curb grate on my side of the street, you'll see the water sitting in front of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:52:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, I really need a location for the crew to find it. Do you have a cross street or a landmark nearby, at least?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:52:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Not one I want to put on a recording, no. I'll just say it's in the neighborhood where I live, and it's the only sunken grate on the block. It's hard to miss."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:53:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll note it as a sunken grate, water bypassing it, traffic slowing, and the caller declined a location. I'll flag that it needs a spot to be dispatched. You can call back with a cross street anytime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:53:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. It's just, this keeps happening every time it rains hard and nobody comes to fix it. I'm tired of looking at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Crews are stretched thin after a storm like that, and drains get triaged. I'll put it in as a repeat complaint if you tell me it's been like this before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It has. Every storm this winter. Sorry, hang on a sec. [crosstalk] No, honey, don't drag that around the kitchen, it's going everywhere. Sorry, Kevin. The kids are home today and somebody's dragging a bag of cereal across the floor, and it's all over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:54:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, sounds like a busy house. School vacation week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Something like that. Anyway, can somebody call me back when it's done? Not before, just when the grate's actually fixed or whatever they do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'll put a callback request on it. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:54:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0164, and the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:54:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Janice Almy. A-L-M-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:54:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Janice. Got it. Callback when the work's done. I'll pass along the note about the missing location, so someone might reach out to confirm where it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:54:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Kevin. I appreciate you taking it this late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:54:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. Take care, and good luck with the cereal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:54:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, thanks. Bye now."
    }
  ],
